## IMDB1 — Two hops from a unique-key start through high-degree titles: the trade-off of placing the middle condition
traits: start=unique key hops=2 fan-out=high aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: p.nconst | R3 middle: t.title_type, t.start_year, t.average_rating | R6 aggregate / sort: q.primary_name

### IMDB1 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(q.primary_name, together)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[together DESC, q.primary_name ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: q.primary_name | count(*) AS together]
  :       GetProperty(q.primary_name) [node:Person]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
  :           Expand((t)<-[_r1:WORKED_ON]-(q:Person))
  :             Filter((p.nconst = "nm0000138"))
  :               GetProperty(p.nconst) [node:Person]
  :                 Expand((t)<-[_r0:WORKED_ON]-(p:Person))
  :                   Filter((t.average_rating >= 7))
  :                     GetProperty(t.average_rating) [node:Title]
  :                       Filter((t.start_year >= 2000))
  :                         GetProperty(t.start_year) [node:Title]
  :                           Filter((t.title_type = "movie"))
  :                             GetProperty(t.title_type) [node:Title]
  :                               EntityScan(t:Title)

### IMDB1 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[together DESC, q.primary_name ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: q.primary_name | count(*) AS together]
      Fetch[mysql] in=(q) out=(q, q.primary_name)
        : GetProperty(q.primary_name) [node:Person]
        :   Argument(q)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(p) out=(p)
          : Filter((p.nconst = "nm0000138"))
          :   GetProperty(p.nconst) [node:Person]
          :     Argument(p)
          StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(t) out=(t, p, q)
            : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
            :   Expand((t)<-[_r1:WORKED_ON]-(q:Person))
            :     Expand((t)<-[_r0:WORKED_ON]-(p:Person))
            :       Argument(t)
            StoreQuery[mysql] out=(t)
              : Filter((t.average_rating >= 7))
              :   GetProperty(t.average_rating) [node:Title]
              :     Filter((t.start_year >= 2000))
              :       GetProperty(t.start_year) [node:Title]
              :         Filter((t.title_type = "movie"))
              :           GetProperty(t.title_type) [node:Title]
              :             EntityScan(t:Title)

