## IMDB2 — Three hops with exploding fan-out: the extreme case where a middle condition off graph sends every intermediate row across stores
traits: start=unique key hops=3 fan-out=explosive aggregate Top-20 | R1 start: p.nconst | R2 end: u.num_votes | R3 middle: t.start_year, q.birth_year | R6 aggregate / sort: u.primary_title

### IMDB2 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(u.primary_title, c)
  : Limit[20]
  :   Sort[c DESC, u.primary_title ASC]
  :     Aggregation[keys: u.primary_title | count(*) AS c]
  :       GetProperty(u.primary_title) [node:Title]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1, _r2]
  :           Filter((u.num_votes >= 100000))
  :             GetProperty(u.num_votes) [node:Title]
  :               Expand((q)-[_r2:WORKED_ON]->(u:Title))
  :                 Filter((q.birth_year >= 1980))
  :                   GetProperty(q.birth_year) [node:Person]
  :                     Expand((t)<-[_r1:WORKED_ON]-(q:Person))
  :                       Filter((t.start_year >= 2010))
  :                         GetProperty(t.start_year) [node:Title]
  :                           Expand((p)-[_r0:WORKED_ON]->(t:Title))
  :                             Filter((p.nconst = "nm0000138"))
  :                               GetProperty(p.nconst) [node:Person]
  :                                 EntityScan(p:Person)

### IMDB2 @relational
Coord Limit[20]
  Coord Sort[c DESC, u.primary_title ASC]
    Coord Aggregation[keys: u.primary_title | count(*) AS c]
      StoreQuery[mysql] in=(u) out=(u, u.primary_title)
        : GetProperty(u.primary_title) [node:Title]
        :   Filter((u.num_votes >= 100000))
        :     GetProperty(u.num_votes) [node:Title]
        :       Argument(u)
        StoreQuery[mysql] in=(q) out=(q)
          : Filter((q.birth_year >= 1980))
          :   GetProperty(q.birth_year) [node:Person]
          :     Argument(q)
          StoreQuery[mysql] in=(t) out=(t)
            : Filter((t.start_year >= 2010))
            :   GetProperty(t.start_year) [node:Title]
            :     Argument(t)
            StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(p) out=(p, q, t, u)
              : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1, _r2]
              :   Expand((q)-[_r2:WORKED_ON]->(u:Title))
              :     Expand((t)<-[_r1:WORKED_ON]-(q:Person))
              :       Expand((p)-[_r0:WORKED_ON]->(t:Title))
              :         Argument(p)
              StoreQuery[mysql] out=(p)
                : Filter((p.nconst = "nm0000138"))
                :   GetProperty(p.nconst) [node:Person]
                :     EntityScan(p:Person)

