## IMDB3 — Two hops from a unique-key start plus a per-year aggregation: the end condition and aggregation absorption
traits: start=unique key hops=2 fan-out=high aggregate | R1 start: t.tconst | R2 end: o.title_type | R6 aggregate / sort: o.start_year, o.average_rating

### IMDB3 @graph
StoreQuery[neo4j] out=(o.start_year, titles, avgRating)
  : Sort[o.start_year ASC]
  :   Aggregation[keys: o.start_year | count(*) AS titles, avg(o.average_rating) AS avgRating]
  :     GetProperty(o.average_rating) [node:Title]
  :       GetProperty(o.start_year) [node:Title]
  :         RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
  :           Filter((o.title_type = "movie"))
  :             GetProperty(o.title_type) [node:Title]
  :               Expand((p)-[_r1:WORKED_ON]->(o:Title))
  :                 Expand((t)<-[_r0:WORKED_ON]-(p:Person))
  :                   Filter((t.tconst = "tt0111161"))
  :                     GetProperty(t.tconst) [node:Title]
  :                       EntityScan(t:Title)

### IMDB3 @relational
Coord Sort[o.start_year ASC]
  Coord Aggregation[keys: o.start_year | count(*) AS titles, avg(o.average_rating) AS avgRating]
    StoreQuery[mysql] in=(o) out=(o, o.average_rating, o.start_year)
      : GetProperty(o.average_rating) [node:Title]
      :   GetProperty(o.start_year) [node:Title]
      :     Filter((o.title_type = "movie"))
      :       GetProperty(o.title_type) [node:Title]
      :         Argument(o)
      StoreQuery[neo4j] in=(t) out=(t, o)
        : RelUniqueFilter[_r0, _r1]
        :   Expand((p)-[_r1:WORKED_ON]->(o:Title))
        :     Expand((t)<-[_r0:WORKED_ON]-(p:Person))
        :       Argument(t)
        StoreQuery[mysql] out=(t)
          : Filter((t.tconst = "tt0111161"))
          :   GetProperty(t.tconst) [node:Title]
          :     EntityScan(t:Title)

